lwIP 2.2.0 (https://savannah.nongnu.org/projects/lwip/), BSD 3-clause
licence (see COPYING). Upstream tag STABLE-2_2_0_RELEASE, commit 0a0452b2c39bdd91e252aef045c115f88f6ca773.

Only src/ is vendored, without the applications (src/apps) and PPP
(src/netif/ppp). OluxOS runs lwIP inside the kernel with NO_SYS=1: the
port (net/lwip/) serialises all lwIP calls on one lock and drives its
timers from a kernel thread; the BSD socket layer (net/inet.c) sits on the
raw TCP/UDP/raw-IP APIs. Local changes: none.
